sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor U as Authorized Customer Manager / Export Officer
 participant View as :UI (Web / Field)
 participant Ctrl as :LedgerEndpoints
 participant T as :LedgerService
 participant Repo as :Npgsql + protected SQL
 participant DB as :Database
 U->>View: Trace source forward or container backward
 View->>Ctrl: Submit request
 Ctrl->>T: Trace source forward or container backward
 T->>T: Check permitted use case and company/facility scope
 T->>+Repo: Read committed lineage, current correction view and loading links
 Repo->>+DB: Read committed lineage, current correction view and loading links
 DB-->>-Repo: Transaction result
 Repo-->>-T: Result / transaction status
 loop All reachable permitted contribution edges
 T->>T: Accumulate source-attributed kg through each operation
 end
 T-->>Ctrl: Complete permitted targets, source kg, mass shares and history basis
 Ctrl-->>View: Operation result and findings
 View-->>U: Display outcome
 Note over U,T: Export Officer participation is UC-25, no implied HOLD<br/>issuance grant
 Note over Ctrl,DB: Existing entry uses LedgerService CommandAsync / ReadAsync / ReceivingAsync.<br/>Detailed logical steps show required protected behavior, including planned extensions.
